rill and excitement of \u201cNinja Warrior\u201d come alive in VR!\nUse every bit of your strength, balance, and reflexes to conquer intense obstacle courses through full-body motion."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_2560\u00d71440px.png", "id": "4206557512967114", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619098_4206557516300447_943281957663249977_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hdETlbTmxjcQ7kNvwEcsfbe&_nc_oc=AdopTPF_GtREgvY0b2vGM672QIG2Vohmhf2rTNhQqXUhyZM8aUWFRVhFlzYuk23l-XI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSVW-aY7yp8gIgh9tYX5RLGHXtfMqRgVDq_rI2eIIBfvw&oe=6B03042F"}, {"file_name": "\u30d2\u30fc\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_3000\u00d7900px.png", "id": "2975615619303809", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619774_2975615622637142_1331376706207959328_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YRw5N8dZvjkQ7kNvwHHWxPL&_nc_oc=Adpv4Md0uw7_XJfmL06oRd0FQDfnDbc5eoYnIeM_U3s5Z4KaV8zQj-eLG-efUMJKqg8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR3ogL-SLkz9qfI07x5KnHlm-VFOIJTa7WmrJbMIlcGXw&oe=6B03161A"}, {"file_name": "\u7e26\u9577\u306e\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_1008\u00d71440px.png", "id": "1459347908497843", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_1459347911831176_5240984296618367253_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Itg0ZxIN6AgQ7kNvwGI17El&_nc_oc=AdqZTbWVJboI7Mo0khz1BSeVcsyA5Fm8ywqGhvVjmw3vMCh-hob-5N0FLB4WBSq4aYo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQGeoBeSJCA_mcv9QvwR5hOZ9HBqQJ38JEzgHu5Lbu8vA&oe=6B03337C"}, {"file_name": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3_512\u00d7512px.png", "id": "1182588407080721", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scon